aws: [ERROR]: An error occurred (UnknownOperationException) when calling the UpdateContinuousBackups operation: An unknown operation was requested.

aws: [ERROR]: An error occurred (ValidationException) when calling the DeleteTable operation: Resource cannot be deleted as it is currently protected against deletion. Disable deletion protection first.
